  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 99 * 11 * 5 * 25 * 15 * 5\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷ − × = +\n\n99 * 11 * 5 * 25 * 15 * 5 ⇒ 99 ÷ 11 - 5 × 25 = 15 + 5\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷**____** 11**__ - 5 × 25 = __**15 +**____** 5**__\n\n⇒ 9 - __**5 **____**×**____** 25**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**9 - 1**____**25**__ = 20\n\n⇒ -116 ≠ 20 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) − ÷ × + =\n\n99 * 11 * 5 * 25 * 15 * 5 ⇒ 99 - 11 ÷ 5 × 25 + 15 = 5\n\n⇒ 99 - __**11 **____**÷**____** 5**__ × 25 + 15 = 5\n\n⇒ 99 - __**2.2**____** ×**____** 25**__ + 15 = 5\n\n⇒ __**99 + 15**__ - 55 = 5\n\n⇒ __114** - 5**____**5**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 59 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ÷ × − = +\n\n99 * 11 * 5 * 25 * 15 * 5 ⇒ 99 ÷ 11 × 5 - 25 = 15 + 5\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷**____** 11**__ × 5 - 25 = __**15 + 5**__\n\n⇒ __**9 ×**____** 5**__ - 25 = 20\n\n⇒ __**45 - 25**__ = 20\n\n⇒ **20** = **20 (LHS** **=** LHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷ − × + =\n\n99 * 11 * 5 * 25 * 15 * 5 ⇒ 99 ÷ 11 - 5 × 25 + 15 = 5\n\n⇒ __**99 ÷**____** 11**__ - 5 × 25 + 15 = 5\n\n⇒ 9 - __**5 **____**×**____** 25**__ + 15 = 5\n\n⇒ __**9**____** + 15**__ - 125 = 5\n\n⇒ **__24__**__** - 1**____**25**__ = 5\n\n⇒ -101 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
